{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07725","headline":"庭橘 · 孟浩然","name":"庭橘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明发览羣物，万木何阴森。\n凝霜渐渐水，庭橘似悬金。\n女伴争攀摘，摘窥碍叶深。\n竝生怜共蒂，相示感同心。\n骨刺红罗被，香黏翠羽簪。\n擎来玉盘里，全胜在幽林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}